u003ckeyword\u003e` lists the tasks whose description contains the keyword\n(case-insensitive), under the header \"Here are the matching tasks in\nyour list:\".\n\n- Parser: new FIND command type and \"find\" keyword\n- TaskList: find(keyword) returns a new TaskList of the matches\n- Ui: showMatchingTasks() renders the results like the normal list\n- Percy: handle FIND; error if no keyword is given\n- TaskListTest: cover matching, case-insensitivity and the no-match case\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018wSSNPecDJy598pQmNWgU5\n","tags":["Level-9"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":83,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"d5a8c8e3c12e668224647b3ac758ee0b8583c48f","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-Level-9\u0027","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"3b682a13540cece97e6d5dc0332e8b24e50c2c5f","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-A-JavaDoc\u0027","messageBody":"# Conflicts:\n#\tsrc/main/java/percy/Percy.java\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"85064bf28bf48dae0000a8ea13aae119db4dc2b5","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-A-CodingStandard\u0027","messageBody":"# Conflicts:\n#\tsrc/main/java/percy/Storage.java\n#\tsrc/main/java/percy/Task.java\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"FatDino789":{"java":1215,"md":10,"fxml":0,"sh":0,"bat":0,"gradle":2,"txt":4}},"authorContributionVariance":{"FatDino789":56368.59},"authorDisplayNameMap":{"FatDino789":"CS2103T-F14-1 YEO ..RALD"}}
